RetailMart Country Sales Analysis

📌 Project Overview

RetailMart Country Sales Analysis is a data analytics project that explores retail sales performance across six countries: Canada, China, India, Nigeria, the United Kingdom, and the United States.

This project uses SQL, PostgreSQL, and Microsoft Power BI to analyze sales transactions, product performance, profitability, payment methods, customer demographics, and store locations.

🎯 Project Objectives

- Analyze sales performance across six countries.
- Identify top-performing products and categories.
- Examine sales and profit by country.
- Evaluate sales representative performance.
- Analyze store locations and payment methods.
- Build interactive Power BI dashboards to support business decisions.

